  Slug: titan-s-breaker
  DisplayName: Titan's Breaker
  IconPath: icons/skills/melee/strike-hammer-destructive-blue.webp
  Description: "Usage any melee weapon in the club, hammer, or axe group, or any
    your melee unarmed Strikes that deals bludgeoning damage You wield a weapon whose
    blows shatter mountains with ease. Immanence The titan's breaker deals 2 additional
    spirit damage per weapon damage die to creatures it Strikes. Constructs and objects
    are not immune to this spirit damage, and this spirit damage automatically bypasses
    an amount of their Hardness equal to your level. Transcendence\u2014 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Fracture
    Mountains] 2 (spirit, transcendence) @Embed[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Ei4T4aQx0a5EdBhm
    inline]"
